@* 게시판 목록 (표준 화면 1 조회): 검색(대상·검색어), 쪽 번호, 글쓰기. 글 제목을 누르면 글 보기 화면으로 간다. *@
@model BoardIndexModel
@{
    var board = Model.Board;
    ViewData["Title"] = board.BoardNm;
    var baseUrl = Url.Content("~/Board/" + board.BoardCd);
}
@section Scripts {
    <script type="module" src="~/js/board/list.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
}
<h1 id="brd-heading">@board.BoardNm</h1>
<div id="brd-screen"
     data-url-list="@baseUrl/List"
     data-url-view="@baseUrl/View/"
     data-url-edit="@baseUrl/Edit">
    <form id="brd-search" class="search-bar" role="search">
        <label for="brd-type">@L["BRD.SEARCH_TYPE"]</label>
        <select id="brd-type">
            <option value="TITLE_CONTENT">@L["BRD.TITLE_CONTENT"]</option>
            <option value="TITLE">@L["LBL.TITLE"]</option>
            <option value="CONTENT">@L["LBL.CONTENT"]</option>
            <option value="WRITER">@L["BRD.WRITER"]</option>
        </select>
        <label for="brd-keyword">@L["LBL.KEYWORD"]</label>
        <input id="brd-keyword" maxlength="100" autocomplete="off" />
        <button type="submit" class="primary"><fw-icon name="search" />@L["BTN.SEARCH"]</button>
    </form>
    <div class="toolbar">
        <p id="brd-total" class="hint toolbar-spacer" aria-live="polite"></p>
        @if (Model.CanCreate)
        {
            <a id="brd-write" class="button primary" href="@baseUrl/Edit"><fw-icon name="pencil" />@L["BRD.WRITE"]</a>
        }
    </div>
    <div class="grid-wrap">
        <table class="fw-grid board-grid" aria-labelledby="brd-heading">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th scope="col">@L["LBL.TITLE"]</th>
                    <th scope="col">@L["BRD.WRITER"]</th>
                    <th scope="col">@L["BRD.REG_DT"]</th>
                    <th scope="col" class="col-num">@L["BRD.VIEW_CNT"]</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody id="brd-body"></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
    <nav id="brd-pager" class="pager" aria-label="@L["LBL.PAGES"]" hidden></nav>
</div>
